Subject: [PATCH 093/110] net: axienet: Add ethernet offload engine support

Add support for ethernet offload engine.

This IP helps to offload the TCP/UDP stack to the network controller by
doing operations like checksum computations and packet segmentation and
reassembly. The system's CPU is freed of part of its processing loadby
offloading these tasks,which can improve network speed and reduce CPU use.

Signed-off-by: Ravikanth Tuniki <ravikanth.tuniki@amd.com>
Signed-off-by: Suraj Gupta <suraj.gupta2@amd.com>
Reviewed-by: Radhey Shyam Pandey <radhey.shyam.pandey@amd.com>
State: pending
Message-ID: <20250107104507.359136-25-suraj.gupta2@amd.com>
